@startuml
title State machine — Verdict of one run
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam state {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
[*] --> Initialising : subscriptions on
Initialising --> Settling : init complete
Initialising --> Unlocking : valid challenge
Settling --> Talks : >= 1 notification, no challenge,\n3,000 ms elapsed (L2-034)
Settling --> Waiting : no notification at 3,000 ms
Settling --> Unlocking : valid challenge
Waiting --> Talks : first notification is not a challenge (L2-034)
Waiting --> Unlocking : valid challenge
Waiting --> Silent : 20,000 ms after init complete (L2-033)
Unlocking --> Unlocked : matching ack within 2,500 ms (L2-024)
Unlocking --> Locked : invalid challenge, no ack,\nor disconnect (L2-022, L2-024, L2-035)
Talks --> Unlocking : later valid challenge (L2-034)
Locked --> Unlocking : new valid challenge (L2-025)
Unlocked --> Unlocking : new valid challenge (L2-025)
Silent --> Silent : late notifications logged only (L2-033)
Initialising --> Silent : disconnect, no reply (L2-035)
Settling --> Talks : disconnect after replies (L2-035)
Waiting --> Silent : disconnect, no reply (L2-035)
Initialising --> Talks : disconnect after replies (L2-035)
Settling --> Silent : disconnect, no reply (L2-035)
Silent --> [*]
Talks --> [*]
Unlocked --> [*]
Locked --> [*]
@enduml
